{
    "title": "My Car - Car Management",
    "description": "My Car is a new generation and modern car app to track gas consumption, fill-ups, mileage, services and costs of your car. Enter all fill-ups and expenses of your car to the app and get detailed and beautiful charts and statistics for every detail of your car. Attach a receipt and other documents to car events. Take a photo of the receipt or pick an existing image, PDF or other document and attach it to the car event. With Premium version you can also setup service reminders, create PDF reports, track private/business trips, track incomes and use the app in all your devices with cloud sync.  \r\n  \r\n<b>Manage all your vehicles efficiently</b>  \r\nUse the app for cars, trucks, motorcycles or buses. The app supports bi-fuel vehicles too such as gasoline/CNG as well as electric vehicles.  \r\n  \r\nCompare your car statistics with your other cars to see which performs best and to detect possible faults in your car.  \r\n  \r\n<b>Track costs and save money</b>  \r\nStop wasting money on a car that is too expensive to maintain. My Car app helps you selling and upgrading your car at the right moment.  \r\n  \r\nFind out how much you spend money on fuel, auto service, auto repair and other car expenses. Compare prices and make better decisions. Find all previous events from the event log quickly and easily.  \r\n  \r\nView and analyze interesting statistics and charts related to your vehicle. There are statistics and charts for every detail of your car.  \r\n  \r\nPremium version allows you to export and print PDF reports from charts, events, costs, incomes and trips.  \r\n  \r\n<b>Fully cross-platform solution</b>  \r\nMy Car app is available for mobile devices, tablets, desktop and Web, optimized for different screen sizes. With Premium version your data is synced into all your devices automatically and in real-time. Your data is stored securely and reliably in a cloud service.  \r\n  \r\n<b>For personal use and for professional drivers</b>  \r\nMy Car is a perfect app also for taxi drivers, drivers of Uber and other similar services, bus companies, transportation companies and other professional drivers. You can even track your income with My Car app (Premium feature).  \r\n  \r\n<b>Key features (free)</b>  \r\n\u2022 Fuel mileage tracker  \r\n\u2022 Track car's costs, car services and fuel efficiency  \r\n\u2022 Vehicle album for photos  \r\n\u2022 Add notes  \r\n\u2022 Attach photos and other documents to any event. For example, attach a photo of the receipt related to the event  \r\n\u2022 Location history for previous fuel station, auto service, auto repair, etc.  \r\n\u2022 View and search event history. Filter events by event type to see all related events quickly  \r\n\u2022 Statistics and charts: fuel efficiency, fuel price, cost structure, monthly costs, monthly fuel costs, costs over mileage, costs per day, cumulative costs, monthly income, cumulative income, average mileage per year, ownership  \r\n\u2022 Manage multiple vehicles (up to 3 vehicles with the free version)  \r\n\u2022 Fuel units: liter, gallon, kg, kWh  \r\n\u2022 Odometer units: km, mile, hour  \r\n\u2022 Fuel efficiency units: mpg, L/100 km, km/L and so on  \r\n\u2022 Support for bi-fuel vehicles (e.g. gasoline/CNG)  \r\n\u2022 Import data from other applications including Fuelio, Fuelly, Drivvo and My Cars  \r\n\u2022 Export/backup your data  \r\n\u2022 Modern, clean user interface and very easy to use  \r\n  \r\n<b>Premium (available as in-app purchase)</b>  \r\n\u2022 Cloud storage and sync  \r\n\u2022 Access your data from any of your mobile devices and PC  \r\n\u2022 Modern Web app for desktop usage (installable PWA)  \r\n\u2022 Export PDF reports from charts, events, costs, incomes and trips  \r\n\u2022 Manage up to 6 vehicles (or up to 100 vehicles with Premium Business)  \r\n\u2022 Add one additional driver. With Premium Business you can add multiple additional drivers and manage their access rights.\r\n\u2022 Track incomes  \r\n\u2022 Service reminders  \r\n\u2022 Trip log  \r\n\u2022 No ads  \r\n\u2022 Unlock all other Premium features\r\n  \r\nMore: https://mycar-app.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "My Car is a new generation and modern car app to track gas consumption, fill-ups, mileage, services and costs of your car. Enter all fill-ups and expenses of your car to the app and get detailed and beautiful charts and statistics for every detail of your car. Attach a receipt and other documents to car events. Take a photo of the receipt or pick an existing image, PDF or other document and attach it to the car event. With Premium version you can also setup service reminders, create PDF reports, track private/business trips, track incomes and use the app in all your devices with cloud sync.  <br>  <br><b>Manage all your vehicles efficiently</b>  <br>Use the app for cars, trucks, motorcycles or buses. The app supports bi-fuel vehicles too such as gasoline/CNG as well as electric vehicles.  <br>  <br>Compare your car statistics with your other cars to see which performs best and to detect possible faults in your car.  <br>  <br><b>Track costs and save money</b>  <br>Stop wasting money on a car that is too expensive to maintain. My Car app helps you selling and upgrading your car at the right moment.  <br>  <br>Find out how much you spend money on fuel, auto service, auto repair and other car expenses. Compare prices and make better decisions. Find all previous events from the event log quickly and easily.  <br>  <br>View and analyze interesting statistics and charts related to your vehicle. There are statistics and charts for every detail of your car.  <br>  <br>Premium version allows you to export and print PDF reports from charts, events, costs, incomes and trips.  <br>  <br><b>Fully cross-platform solution</b>  <br>My Car app is available for mobile devices, tablets, desktop and Web, optimized for different screen sizes. With Premium version your data is synced into all your devices automatically and in real-time. Your data is stored securely and reliably in a cloud service.  <br>  <br><b>For personal use and for professional drivers</b>  <br>My Car is a perfect app also for taxi drivers, drivers of Uber and other similar services, bus companies, transportation companies and other professional drivers. You can even track your income with My Car app (Premium feature).  <br>  <br><b>Key features (free)</b>  <br>\u2022 Fuel mileage tracker  <br>\u2022 Track car&#39;s costs, car services and fuel efficiency  <br>\u2022 Vehicle album for photos  <br>\u2022 Add notes  <br>\u2022 Attach photos and other documents to any event. For example, attach a photo of the receipt related to the event  <br>\u2022 Location history for previous fuel station, auto service, auto repair, etc.  <br>\u2022 View and search event history. Filter events by event type to see all related events quickly  <br>\u2022 Statistics and charts: fuel efficiency, fuel price, cost structure, monthly costs, monthly fuel costs, costs over mileage, costs per day, cumulative costs, monthly income, cumulative income, average mileage per year, ownership  <br>\u2022 Manage multiple vehicles (up to 3 vehicles with the free version)  <br>\u2022 Fuel units: liter, gallon, kg, kWh  <br>\u2022 Odometer units: km, mile, hour  <br>\u2022 Fuel efficiency units: mpg, L/100 km, km/L and so on  <br>\u2022 Support for bi-fuel vehicles (e.g. gasoline/CNG)  <br>\u2022 Import data from other applications including Fuelio, Fuelly, Drivvo and My Cars  <br>\u2022 Export/backup your data  <br>\u2022 Modern, clean user interface and very easy to use  <br>  <br><b>Premium (available as in-app purchase)</b>  <br>\u2022 Cloud storage and sync  <br>\u2022 Access your data from any of your mobile devices and PC  <br>\u2022 Modern Web app for desktop usage (installable PWA)  <br>\u2022 Export PDF reports from charts, events, costs, incomes and trips  <br>\u2022 Manage up to 6 vehicles (or up to 100 vehicles with Premium Business)  <br>\u2022 Add one additional driver. With Premium Business you can add multiple additional drivers and manage their access rights.<br>\u2022 Track incomes  <br>\u2022 Service reminders  <br>\u2022 Trip log  <br>\u2022 No ads  <br>\u2022 Unlock all other Premium features<br>  <br>More: https://mycar-app.com",
